---
// The title block: three columns, real fields only.
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div>
    <div class="w">
      <img
        src="/brand/vwf-mark-small-white.svg"
        width="22"
        height="22"
        alt=""
      />vwf
    </div>
    <p>
      Claude Code plugins, authored natively. MIT licensed. Authored by Viraj
      Patel.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <div class="h">Read</div>
    <a href="/plugins/vwf/">vwf manual</a>
    <a href="/plugins/stackgen/">stackgen manual</a>
    <a href="/how-to/">Guides</a>
    <a href="/installer/">Installer</a>
  </div>
  <div>
    <div class="h">Source</div>
    <a href="https://github.com/virajp/claude-plugins"
    >github.com/virajp/claude-plugins</a>
    <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@virajp.dev/claude-plugins"
    >npm: @virajp.dev/claude-plugins</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/virajp/claude-plugins#credits--acknowledgements"
    >Credits</a>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    margin-top: var(--section-gap);
    padding: 40px 0 64px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
  }
  .w {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font: 300 24px var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .footer p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 12px;
    max-width: 34ch;
  }
  .footer a {
    display: block;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--mist);
    text-decoration: none;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .footer a:hover {
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .h {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .footer {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
